WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:06.924
(cash register ringing)

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.091
- Good to see you, Ghostwriter.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.303
- Follow the money.
What money?

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.097
- Who's S?

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:15.557
- Looks like we found
our number one suspect.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:16.475
-Let's do this.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.145
- Why would Ghostwriter
release characters from the book

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:21.271
unless they were here to help us?

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:23.023
- I am pretty good at solving mysteries.

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:28.028
- Sparkles. They're memories
left behind by other people.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.659
- She's incredible.
- Follow the money.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.953
- You have the best superpower ever.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.163
- Give me a break.
You can talk to ghosts.

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:39.456
- You're telling me.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:44.086
- There's a monster on the loose.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.796
- Monster?
- (dog whines)

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.506
- Frankenstein.

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.383
- It was foolish of me to create life.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:51.760
- Cool.

00:00:51.844 --> 00:00:53.178
- We have very different
definitions of "cool."

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.765
- We should be formulating
a plan to destroy the monster.

00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:58.809
- Let's see if she can help us
with her superpowers.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.145
- Watching memories
is way harder than it looks.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.689
Let me handle the sparkles.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.776
- Curtis and Ruben
are stuck in a sparkle.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.528
- This has never happened before.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:11.196
- We have to solve this mystery.

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:13.699
It's the only way to get to the truth.

00:01:15.242 --> 00:01:16.285
- What have you done?

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:17.786
- We need to leave. Now!

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:19.037
-(roar)
- Aah!

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:23.458
- We come in peace.

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:26.128
- See? I got this.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:28.964
- I don't got this!

